# AI Data Engineering Agent

## 1. What we are building

A portfolio-grade **agentic AI data analysis system** where a user can ask:

> "Which product category generated the most revenue?"

or:

> "Compare revenue between Enterprise and SMB customers."

The system will autonomously determine what it needs to do, use the appropriate tools, validate its work, recover from errors, and return a grounded answer.

