## Phase 2 — Gemini NL → SQL 🔜

This is our next major step.

We'll build:

```text
Natural language question
        ↓
Schema context
        ↓
Gemini
        ↓
SQL
        ↓
SQLGlot
        ↓
Safe executor
```

Example:

```text
User:
"Which category generated the most revenue?"
```

Gemini should produce something conceptually like:

```sql
SELECT
    p.category,
    SUM(
        oi.quantity *
        oi.unit_price *
        (1 - oi.discount)
    ) AS revenue
FROM order_items oi
JOIN orders o
    ON o.id = oi.order_id
JOIN products p
    ON p.id = oi.product_id
WHERE o.status = 'completed'
GROUP BY p.category
ORDER BY revenue DESC;
```

Our application—not Gemini—will validate and execute it.

