# 15. Phase 4 — Pandas analysis 🔜

We'll create controlled analytical operations such as:

```text
group_by
aggregate
sort
compare_periods
percentage_change
describe
detect_missing_values
```

Instead of allowing the LLM to generate arbitrary Python:

```python
exec(...)
```

the LLM will select structured operations.

For example:

```text
operation: percentage_change
metric: revenue
group_by: category
period_1: Q1
period_2: Q2
```

Our Python code performs the actual calculation.

This is much safer and more interview-defensible.

